    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36604" root="كبس" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُكَبِّسٌ</span></b>  <i>Hanging down his head in his garment:</i>
(K, * TA:) or one <i>who throws himself suddenly
and without consideration upon others, and
assaults them.</i> (K.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَابِسٌ</span>.

